{"title":"Career Roadmap · Cloud Support Engineer","role":"Cloud Support Engineer","summary":"A Cloud Support Engineer helps organizations deploy, operate, troubleshoot, and maintain applications and infrastructure on cloud platforms. The role combines Linux, networking, cloud services, scripting, monitoring, databases, security, and DevOps practices.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. — Engineering & Technology","Course":"CSE – Full Stack / DevOps / SRE (Industry-integrated)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Cloud Support Engineer helps organizations deploy, operate, troubleshoot, and maintain applications and infrastructure on cloud platforms. The role combines Linux, networking, cloud services, scripting, monitoring, databases, security, and DevOps practices."},{"type":"p","text":"For a CSE program integrated with Full Stack / DevOps / SRE, this is a strong entry-level target because students can build both application and infrastructure knowledge."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Troubleshoot cloud infrastructure and application issues"},{"text":"Manage virtual machines, storage, networks, and databases"},{"text":"Monitor cloud resources and application health"},{"text":"Handle incidents and service requests"},{"text":"Configure IAM, security groups, DNS, load balancers, etc."},{"text":"Automate repetitive operational tasks"},{"text":"Support deployments and CI/CD pipelines"},{"text":"Analyze logs and performance metrics"},{"text":"Work with development and DevOps teams"},{"text":"Document incidents, fixes, and operational procedures"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech / B.E.","Cloud / DevOps Intern","Cloud Support Engineer","Cloud Engineer / DevOps Engineer","Senior Cloud / DevOps Engineer","Cloud / SRE Lead","Cloud Architect / Platform Architect","Cloud Eng